  "description": {
    "raw": "Any creature of chaotic, neutral, or evil alignment who targets you with a spell must succeed at a Will save or take a –4 penalty on Intelligence-, Wisdom-, and Charisma-based checks for the spell’s duration. Creatures with only neutral alignment components receive a +4 bonus on their Will saves against this spell. The penalties for alignment components stack (therefore, a chaotic evil spellcaster would take a –8 penalty).",
    "search_text": "\"any creature of chaotic, neutral, or evil alignment who targets you with a spell must succeed at a will save or take a –4 penalty on intelligence-, wisdom-, and charisma-based checks for the spell’s duration. creatures with only neutral alignment components receive a +4 bonus on their will saves against this spell. the penalties for alignment components stack (therefore, a chaotic evil spellcaster would take a –8 penalty).\"",
